<title>UK: Ex-dividends to take 2.87 points off FTSE, April 1.</title>
<headline>Ex-dividends to take 2.87 points off FTSE, April 1.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following FTSE 100 stocks will go ex-dividend on April 1 and analysts estimate the effect will be to take 2.87 points off the index that day.</p>
<p>					DIVIDEND   INDEX</p>
<p>						     (PENCE)  EFFECT</p>
<p>  COMPANY			     Net     Gross    Gross</p>
<p> * Blue Circle Industries	 9.00   11.25    0.484</p>
<p> * Guinness			  11.55   14.44    1.588</p>
<p> * Kingfisher			14.00   17.50    0.683</p>
<p> * Lasmo (Ordinary)		 (a)     2.00    0.112</p>
<p>(a) The dividend for Lasmo is a Foreign Income Dividend (FID) of 2p.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7954</p>
</text>
